Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.43,0:00:03.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.99,0:00:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,月光下化身成一个凶残的杀人野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}A freak animal killing machine by moonlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.99,0:00:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼人很难对付的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, werewolves are badass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.83,0:00:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经知道如何撂倒这些家伙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We already know how to bring these suckers down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.68,0:00:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他们心脏来颗银弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of these bad boys right to the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.14,0:00:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实出了些问题 非常不对劲 我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something wrong with me, really wrong. I need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.65,0:00:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你每天睡多久 - 不睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How much do you sleep? - I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.98,0:00:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不睡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}At all?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.70,0:00:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的灵魂 不见了 - 那在哪儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's his soul. It's gone. - So, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.57,0:00:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该还在封印米迦勒和路西法的牢笼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still in the cage with Michael and Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.94,0:00:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那该死的是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.10,0:00:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那也许是个始祖 - 始祖 就像\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It may have been an alpha. - An alpha? Like …
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.44,0:00:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是那些怪物的祖先\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first one who spawned all the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.11,0:00:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里面学问可多着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's tons of lore about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.35,0:00:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我捕猎去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,越是食物链的顶端越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aim high on the food chain, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.58,0:00:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们可不是你的娇娃 - 绝对是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We ain't your employees. - Of course you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.64,0:00:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不过是个在十字路口晃悠的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're nothing but a punk-ass crossroads demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是曾经了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was a punk-ass crossroads demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今 已是地狱之王了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now? King of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.41,0:00:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需动动手指 就能让萨姆的灵魂归位\N{\fnArial\fs30}I snap my fingers, Sam gets his soul back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.59,0:00:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我就再把萨姆推回那个牢笼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I shove Sam right back in the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.67,0:00:52.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:01:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他吃了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.39,0:01:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经给他洗过澡了 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave him a bath, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.04,0:01:03.08,Note,0,0,0,0,,（布法罗 纽约州）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.36,0:01:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你有带他去公园吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, did you take him to the park?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.90,0:01:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他嘘嘘和便便了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And did he make pee-pee and poo-poo?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.06,0:01:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.64,0:01:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他爹地爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him Daddy loves him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.71,0:01:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be home soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.70,0:01:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鬼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.99,0:01:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第6季第8集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.46,0:02:01.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（肥佬的肋骨小屋）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.56,0:02:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 鲍比 但肯定还有别的办法吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, Bobby, but there's got to be another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.75,0:02:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 继续查呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Keep digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.31,0:02:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果克劳力认为我们会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if Crowley thinks we're just gonna …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.41,0:02:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力认为你们会怎样啊 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley thinks you're just gonna what, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.38,0:02:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是鲍比·辛格吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that Bobby Singer?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.42,0:02:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我亲他一口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him a kiss for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.22,0:02:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一会儿再打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.18,0:02:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息 小伙子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good news, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.91,0:02:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有份儿差事交给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a job for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.29,0:02:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好话不说第二遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna say this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.90,0:02:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着你的差事给我见鬼去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can take your job and shove it up your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.22,0:02:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你跟自己老板说话的态度么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that any way to talk to your boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.52,0:02:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,少给我装老大 蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not my boss, dickbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.34,0:02:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩啊迪恩 早说过了 别傲娇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, Dean. Been through this. Quit clutching your pearls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.10,0:02:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经为我工作一段时间了 萨姆就更长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been working for me for some time now. Sam here, longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.10,0:02:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当初又不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.01,0:02:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,知不知道对你来说有啥区别么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that makes a difference to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.70,0:02:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在根本是为达目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd sell your brother for a dollar right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.81,0:02:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以不管你老哥的死活\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you really needed a soda.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.60,0:02:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着 我想派你们… - 不干\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, I'm sending you - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.46,0:02:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beg pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是做过一些见不得人的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done some shady stuff in my time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.94,0:02:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不会干这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I am not doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.19,0:03:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不干\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.57,0:03:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,十英镑赌你会同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 quid says you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.32,0:03:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢痛感吗 萨姆 你喜欢地狱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like pain, Sam? You like hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.23,0:03:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别以为这事儿还有商量的余地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to stop thinking of this as some kind of deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.60,0:03:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我说了算 没的商量 你个傲慢的臭东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a hostage situation, you arrogant little thug.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.30,0:03:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老弟的命在我手上 搞清楚了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I own your brother! Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.37,0:03:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 迪恩 笑笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dean, smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.82,0:03:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没那么糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.71,0:03:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你点儿犒劳吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's incentive …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.83,0:03:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你抓一个活的始祖给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bag me a live alpha,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应你会双手奉还小萨萨的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll give you little Sammy's soul back, with a cherry on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.07,0:03:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 吸血鬼始祖还不能满足你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, alpha vamp not good enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.87,0:03:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好别插嘴得好 除非你不想活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best mind where you poke your nose, if you want to keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩愉快的猎捕旅程从这儿开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your merry little hike up the food chain starts here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.09,0:03:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个商人死在自己车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Businessman found dead in his car …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.48,0:04:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,胸部被刨开 心脏不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chest ripped open, heart missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.87,0:04:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听起来像什么呢 - 狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sounds like? - Werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.87,0:04:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这不是满月日\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not a full moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.71,0:04:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼人都是在满月之时变身 真凹凸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Werewolves turning on the full moon … so '09.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.49,0:04:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.75,0:04:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个月前的半月日 我和萨穆埃尔杀过一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel and I ganked one about six months back on the half-moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.34,0:04:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来这种不正常情况已经持续一段时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things have been out of whack for a while now, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.54,0:04:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我想也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.58,0:04:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 就这么定了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it's settled then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去猎捕那狼人 把它给咱带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bag the howler, bring it home to papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.03,0:04:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,回见了 帅小伙子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you soon, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.00,0:04:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,受害人还真是事业有成\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the vic's a real class act.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.90,0:04:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,即拥有一大批的廉价公寓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Owned a bunch of slum-grade apartments.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.04,0:04:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有些独立式房屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple houses, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.29,0:04:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样了吗 你就打算这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is it? This is … this is what you're gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.21,0:04:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.18,0:04:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力 他一直把我们玩弄于股掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley. He's so far up our asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.08,0:04:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想甩都甩不掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're … we're … we're coughing sulfur,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.19,0:04:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你 你居然就开始研究起这案子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you … you're just gonna work the case?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.14,0:04:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 他掐住了我们的命门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's got us by the short and curlies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.64,0:05:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还能怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.45,0:05:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是… 老弟 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just … you know, man, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.04,0:05:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在是在帮恶魔干活儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working for a demon now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.63,0:05:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至不知道你究竟是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.98,0:05:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.43,0:05:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是需要点儿时间来消化下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need a second to adjust.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.99,0:05:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这确实是个糟糕的局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…This is a crap situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.46,0:05:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.31,0:05:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是迪恩 我还是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Dean, I am still me …
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.71,0:05:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样的大脑 同样的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}same melon, same memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.10,0:05:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢的音乐也没变\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I still like the same music.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.87,0:05:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还想着苏西·海泽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still think about Suzie Heizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.31,0:05:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,生物课上那个苏西·海泽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biology class Suzie Heizer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.77,0:05:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能怪我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you blame me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.02,0:05:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know you don't trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.61,0:05:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做的一切也覆水难收\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't take back what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.84,0:05:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我会证明给你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm going to prove it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.85,0:05:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我依然是你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.65,0:06:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我们是霍尔特和威尔逊探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing? Agents Holt and Wilson.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.13,0:06:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,联调局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feds?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.92,0:06:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦调查员来这里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the feds doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.53,0:06:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是特派专员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we're specialists.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.85,0:06:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,专门被指派来回答那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}They call us in to answer the questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.23,0:06:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢多管闲事儿的人提出的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}of mouth-breathing dick monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.97,0:06:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要给我们详细讲解下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you gonna walk us through this,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.71,0:06:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者\N{\fnArial\fs30}or, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.65,0:06:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是码头工人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dock worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.63,0:06:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,上早班的工人发现了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy on the morning shift found him …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.07,0:06:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,胸腔被撕裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}chest ripped wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,和车里那具尸体一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same as the body in the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.40,0:06:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 两天之内出现了两具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, second one in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.15,0:06:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,两具尸体的内脏都不见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Internal organs missing on both vics?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.37,0:06:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like their hearts?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.65,0:06:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…Looks like it, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.57,0:06:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.61,0:06:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人 他有什么仇人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this guy, he … he have any enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.19,0:06:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 树敌很多 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, plenty, but, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.70,0:06:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他不可能和\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it was a wolf or possibly a cougar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.27,0:06:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼或者豹子发生冲突吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that had a beef with the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.45,0:06:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们应该明白吧 这只是动物袭击罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do realize these were animal attacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.53,0:06:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,动物怎么会来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}An animal out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.33,0:06:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得它是跑来坐船的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you think it came for the sailing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.01,0:07:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.73,0:07:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.48,0:07:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你不用睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you don't…sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.69,0:07:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.85,0:07:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 真是一点都不惊悚啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's not creepy at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.07,0:07:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没办法啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like I can help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.27,0:07:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就那么躺着看着我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you gonna just lay there staring at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.81,0:07:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要听听我的发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you want to hear what I dug up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.28,0:07:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.08,0:07:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we know that werewolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.34,0:07:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,大多数天性残忍狂躁 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}are basically id gone wild, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.99,0:07:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们憎恨谁 就会在变身后把谁干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, whoever they hate, they kill when they wolf out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.01,0:07:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在找受害者之间的联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I've been playing connect the victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.89,0:07:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.79,0:07:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我找到了他们的共同点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think I found a common denominator.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.58,0:07:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So come on. Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.03,0:07:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the lead out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.76,0:07:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器战警 等我穿好衣服先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get dressed, robocop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.60,0:08:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么可以效劳的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.85,0:08:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔·哥瑞肯在家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Cal Garrigan at home?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.21,0:08:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有些问题想问问他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a few questions we'd like to ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.16,0:08:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在家 请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Um, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.01,0:08:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.00,0:08:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去自己房间玩一会儿行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}why don't you go play in your room for a little while, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.54,0:08:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 有点乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse the mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.29,0:08:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.63,0:08:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位喝点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…Can I get you guys anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.28,0:08:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.21,0:08:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔是你男朋友对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, so Cal is your boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.16,0:08:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.76,0:08:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.18,0:08:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在睡吧 我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, sleeping, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.12,0:08:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以叫醒他吗 他有客来访\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind telling him up and at 'em? He's got some guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.18,0:08:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.13,0:08:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cal…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.03,0:09:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,旺财 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky, shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.06,0:09:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are agents…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.13,0:09:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍尔特和威尔逊 早安 吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holt and Wilson. Morning…Ish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.90,0:09:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.54,0:09:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何贵干\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.52,0:09:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚很晚才回家吗 卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You out late last night, Cal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.33,0:09:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是 和朋友喝了几杯啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, uh, you know, a couple beers with friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.71,0:09:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝了几杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many's a couple?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.11,0:09:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 三杯 最多四杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Three, four tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.44,0:09:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你就喝了点儿啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}If all you had was beer,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.84,0:09:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你满身伏特加的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}then how come you're sweating vodka?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.02,0:09:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我猜你是穿着那些衣服睡觉的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And looks to me like you slept in those clothes. Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.48,0:09:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I-I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.37,0:09:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你的意思就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what you're saying is,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.49,0:09:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喝得烂醉 不省人事\N{\fnArial\fs30}you got blind drunk, you blacked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.92,0:09:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这好像不是第一次了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something tells me this isn't the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.73,0:09:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 说老实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Cal, truthfully,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼知道你晚上究竟去了哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}who knows what you've really been up to at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.79,0:09:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们到底想怎样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, what's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.44,0:09:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在调查罗纳德·哥瑞肯被杀的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're investigating the death of Ronald Garrigan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.38,0:09:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.17,0:09:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,请节哀顺变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry for your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:09:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为是动物袭击之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I thought that was some kind of animal attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.13,0:10:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们兄弟俩关系不太好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No love lost between the two of you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.08,0:10:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是有不同之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we had our differences, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.77,0:10:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然爱我的哥哥 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You love your brother, of course, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.17,0:10:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗纳德有很多问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ron had a lot of problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.57,0:10:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他情绪很不稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was, uh, volatile.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.18,0:10:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次他来你家 你还报警了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time he was here, you called the cops?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他喝得烂醉 跑到我家来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, look, he came in here all messed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.13,0:10:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还大吼大叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he was yelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.12,0:10:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还对曼迪动手 所以我就报警了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He shoved Mandy. So, yeah, I called the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.31,0:10:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这和他的死有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see how that has to do with …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.40,0:10:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的房东这周死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your landlord was found dead this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.66,0:10:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you aware of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.92,0:10:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,报纸上登了 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw it in the papers. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.74,0:10:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩欠了好几个月的房租\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you two were pretty far behind on your rent, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.62,0:10:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他下了逐客令 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had sent eviction papers?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.32,0:10:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.34,0:10:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,房东是动物攻击致死\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was an animal attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.56,0:10:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,巧的很啊 他俩都是因此丧命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny enough, yeah … both of 'em were.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.72,0:10:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,很巧 是啊 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, great, great. Yeah, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.33,0:10:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们的死干我鸟事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the hell do you think I had to do with 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.63,0:10:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是按规矩办事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just following procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.41,0:10:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得不来问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.76,0:10:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们今天愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two have a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.35,0:11:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔很爱玩儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Cal's a prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.97,0:11:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 他连自己昨晚身在何处都糊里糊涂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, doesn't even know where he was last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.14,0:11:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就去搞定他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bag him now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.17,0:11:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 咱们得先搞清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We make sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.14,0:11:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.04,0:11:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,在把他交到恶魔手里各种受虐之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we hand him over to a lifetime of demon rape?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.22,0:11:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当然要搞清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.33,0:11:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 卡尔还真是喝个不停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, Cal just doesn't know when to quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.76,0:11:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,三家小酒吧 一家脱衣舞俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three scuzzy bars, one scuzzy strip club,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.24,0:11:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,一根大麻烟卷 外加七八杯睡前安神酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}a chili-dog joint, seven or eight nightcaps,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.58,0:12:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又在仓库里狂饮威士忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now… scotches in the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.09,0:12:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我就觉得自己会得肝硬化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting cirrhosis just watching this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.42,0:12:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了这些 我们一点成果都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other than that, we got squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.07,0:12:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别心急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.28,0:12:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 天亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, sun's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.11,0:12:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙还是没变形\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy's still on two legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.79,0:12:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上来讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}In theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.43,0:12:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会狼变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ain't wolfing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.07,0:12:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚是没戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not tonight, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.15,0:12:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们撤吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.30,0:12:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚些时候再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can re-attack this in a couple hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.13,0:13:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,回见 哥们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catch you later, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.62,0:13:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,旺财\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.06,0:13:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这干嘛呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.29,0:13:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.76,0:13:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.19,0:14:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,旺财 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.49,0:14:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.45,0:14:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,死性不改\N{\fnArial\fs30}Typical.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.37,0:14:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,旺财\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.55,0:14:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.23,0:15:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我唯一正经的男友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the only decent boyfriend I have ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.69,0:15:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来大胆预测一下 看来不是卡尔干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go out on a limb and say that it's not Cal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.51,0:15:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝妙的推理 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Masterful deduction, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.26,0:15:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼人怎么会在大白天袭击人类呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, a werewolf attack in daylight?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.50,0:15:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事简直太诡异了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole thing is just weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.05,0:15:50.58,Title,0,0,0,0,,猫狗大混居（《捉鬼敢死队》中经典台词） 乱成一团了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dogs and cats living together … mass hysteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.58,0:15:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you know this means.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.27,0:15:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在只有一个嫌疑人了 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we're down to one suspect, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.20,0:15:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.97,0:15:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有受害者都和曼迪有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Mandy is right at the deep end of the vic pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.59,0:16:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能搞定么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.29,0:16:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.21,0:16:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她塞进后备箱 交给克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shove her in the trunk, serve her up to Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.48,0:16:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我能搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Sam, I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.21,0:16:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 还烧么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still feeling hot, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.80,0:16:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝点果汁 能好受一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, have some juice. Make you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.32,0:16:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.90,0:16:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.19,0:16:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,旺财真贴心 知道你不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky knows you're not feeling well,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.61,0:16:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想让你开心一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he wants you to feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.77,0:16:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很爱你 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He loves you, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.55,0:16:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖 真乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.74,0:16:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.39,0:16:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他很喜欢吱吱的声音 - 恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He loves a squeak. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.61,0:16:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,腿断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The leg broke off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.70,0:16:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,旺财 看你干的好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky, look what you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.77,0:16:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰你看新闻了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, am I interrupting the morning show?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.49,0:16:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 咱们出去转转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.51,0:17:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是血迹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, is that blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.00,0:17:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又把小鸟咬死了是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you killed a bird again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.29,0:17:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.47,0:17:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.53,0:17:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那回见了 - 拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See you later. - Bye. Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.52,0:17:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.87,0:17:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.05,0:17:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何贵干\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.26,0:17:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人通知你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody called you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.04,0:17:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Called me about what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.90,0:17:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.16,0:17:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.05,0:17:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.29,0:17:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 我知道 现在可能不太合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, I know this isn't the best time,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.51,0:17:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们希望您能跟我们走一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we'd like you to come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.74,0:17:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 你们觉得这是我干的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? You think I have something to do with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.54,0:17:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我害了卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Cal?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.54,0:17:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.54,0:17:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想问您一些问题 一些细节而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just got a few questions … I's and t's, mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.27,0:17:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.17,0:17:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能改天再谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could we do it later?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.88,0:17:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恐怕不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.73,0:18:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的小孩感冒了 折腾了一晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}My s… my kid has the flu, um, and he was up all night, so …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.11,0:18:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我们走之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, is there a neighbor or a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.26,0:18:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,能找邻居或者朋友帮忙看孩子么\N{\fnArial\fs30}who can watch him while you're gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.55,0:18:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 您说您儿子昨天一夜没睡对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. You said your boy was up all night?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.45,0:18:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.27,0:18:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直和他在一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you with him all night?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.38,0:18:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我中间可能睡了半个小时吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I had, um, half an hour of sleep, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.70,0:18:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能和您儿子谈谈吗 - 谈什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I talk to your son? - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.03,0:18:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍尔特探员 还有什么好谈的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what difference does that make, Agent Holt?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.94,0:18:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 这很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me. It's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.97,0:18:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.54,0:18:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it wasn't her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.51,0:18:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可说不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.75,0:18:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有不在场证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got an alibi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.86,0:18:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.03,0:18:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到那孩子作证了 老弟 她没撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard the kid, dude. She's not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是 她还是有时间变身的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. She still had time to wolf out, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.33,0:18:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次那狼人还跟我一起在床上呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last werewolf was in bed, with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.22,0:18:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不是变身行凶去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she wolfed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.73,0:18:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是针对你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make this personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.53,0:18:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, all I'm saying is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.47,0:18:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事 还有那些白天攻击人类的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}that between this and the daylight attacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.10,0:18:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么都解释不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}something's not adding up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.30,0:18:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不查清原委\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not just gonna hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.19,0:18:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不会把她交给克劳利的\N{\fnArial\fs30}her over to Crowley until we figure out what.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.53,0:18:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.83,0:18:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.87,0:19:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如你去看看卡尔的死亡现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout you go check out Cal's crime scene,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.59,0:19:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我们有没有遗漏线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}see if we're missing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.78,0:19:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回去监视阿曼达\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll come back and keep an eye on Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.16,0:19:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如你去 我留下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout you go and I'll stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.28,0:19:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我还没到不知道怎样工作的份上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I still know how to do my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.90,0:19:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是看着她 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna watch her. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.21,0:19:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.02,0:22:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ok, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.38,0:22:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去急救站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta find a aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.87,0:22:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.91,0:22:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.26,0:22:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 等等 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait! Wait, wait! Mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.46,0:22:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 那是我的狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, mister, wait! That's my dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.96,0:22:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.99,0:22:45.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（莉莎）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.85,0:23:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.90,0:23:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.25,0:23:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这啥也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got bupkes here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.00,0:23:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有收获\N{\fnArial\fs30}I definitely got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.31,0:23:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码 肯定不是狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't a werewolf, for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.82,0:23:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.02,0:23:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,剥皮行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skinwalker.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.59,0:23:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,剥皮行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}A skinwalker?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.92,0:23:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.68,0:23:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说 他们家那狗该阉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in, the family dog seriously needs a neuter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.94,0:23:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.65,0:23:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多年没见过剥皮行者了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't of a skinwalker in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.23,0:23:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对这概念有点儿生疏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm actually a little rusty on the profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.02,0:23:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me both.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.17,0:23:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚找鲍比了解了一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I just got the low down from Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.54,0:23:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以随时随地变身\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can change anywhere, anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.19,0:23:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要被咬上一口就会被传染\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skinwalkers infect you with a single bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.17,0:23:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他方面他们就像狼人的表亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, they're basically a werewolf cousin …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.44,0:23:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,惧怕银器 嗜人心如狗粮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silver will drop 'em, they chow hearts like snausages.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.91,0:23:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你遇上了啥情况 抓到他了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what happened? Did you catch him?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.44,0:23:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有 不过我大概知道他会在哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly. But I have some idea where he might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.10,0:23:45.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（瑞县宠物医院）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.04,0:23:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,旺财你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya, Lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.85,0:23:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.07,0:24:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,先说要紧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}First thing's first.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.97,0:24:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吗 银弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}you see this? This is silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.97,0:24:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说我没警告过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say I didn't warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.32,0:24:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.91,0:24:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 你是要吃敬酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we can either do this the easy way … hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.57,0:24:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是吃罚酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.72,0:24:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,咋了 不管有没有灵魂 这招都很搞笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Soul or not, that's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.44,0:24:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么跟你说吧 旺财\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got to tell you, Lucky,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.36,0:24:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难住我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got us stumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.84,0:24:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么跟那家人住一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, why shack up with the family?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.86,0:24:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,某种变态爱好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it a kinky thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.96,0:24:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢玩弄食物是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you like to play with your food?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.40,0:24:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,旺财 打个滚 说话呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roll over, Lucky. Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.54,0:24:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,下地狱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.48,0:24:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,去过了 不适应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already been. Didn't agree with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.72,0:24:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如这样 我拿这把银刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, look, how about I take this silver knife,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.51,0:25:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你修修形状 教你学乖些\N{\fnArial\fs30}and start carving some dog until you behave?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.21,0:25:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎样就来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do what you got to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.19,0:25:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 慢着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.87,0:25:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要告诉我为啥跟那家人在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you don't have to tell me why you're with the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.78,0:25:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.88,0:25:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you do, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.19,0:25:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了所有威胁到他们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed every threat that came near them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.97,0:25:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你关心他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You care about them,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.00,0:25:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,以你那种愚不可及的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}in your own whack-a-doodle kind of way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.44,0:25:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.50,0:25:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要知道的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I want to know is,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.61,0:25:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个跟你说话的人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}who was that guy you were kibitzing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.22,0:25:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也是剥皮行者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He a skinwalker, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.95,0:25:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I can't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.29,0:25:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不说 那女人和小男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you don't, then you're gonna put.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.57,0:25:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会因你而有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}the girl and the little boy in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.62,0:25:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,早晚有一天 这些麻烦事会找上他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sooner or later, all this crap is gonna come for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.05,0:25:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们才不在乎你死活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look, we don't give a rat's ass about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.82,0:25:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想救的是他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.73,0:26:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们的立场\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's our angle. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.43,0:26:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 那家伙是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that guy, he's a…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.73,0:26:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我一样的什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever it is I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.53,0:26:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是唯一一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's not the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.18,0:26:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.91,0:26:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概三十\N{\fnArial\fs30}About 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.69,0:26:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是 都算是被征召的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were all … we were kind of recruited.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.78,0:26:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,征召\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recruited?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.80,0:26:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我当时流落街头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Me, I was living on the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.86,0:26:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们找到了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.53,0:26:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我说 只要咬一小口\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told me one small bite,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.22,0:26:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就能变得又快又强\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be strong, I'd be fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.39,0:26:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,给人当跟屁虫 还真是很大的进步啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sniffing people's butts? Yeah, that's a real step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.03,0:26:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说的确如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it was for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.22,0:26:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们那个史酷比小帮派在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is this little Scooby gang of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.69,0:26:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.08,0:26:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在外面寻找合适的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're out there finding families,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.13,0:26:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦他们收留了我们 我们就「潜伏」下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and once they take us in, we lay low.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.28,0:26:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,「潜伏」 什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Lay low"? What the hell's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.87,0:26:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们会等待一个命令 - 什么命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, we're waiting for the word. - What word?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.32,0:26:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦稳定下来 我们就会收到信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we're settled, we get the signal…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.26,0:26:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们就会袭击收留我们的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and we all turn on our families.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.48,0:27:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会在一夜之间转化他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We change them, all in one night.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.16,0:27:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是30个就会变成150个\N{\fnArial\fs30}30 becomes 150.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.43,0:27:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 你们就像「潜伏」的癌细胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, you're a sleeper cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.26,0:27:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说也对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, that's one way to say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.17,0:27:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 发出命令的是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're waiting for word from who?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.80,0:27:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的头儿是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who organized you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.14,0:27:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个兽群领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a pack leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.83,0:27:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的始祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Alpha?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.63,0:27:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,始祖是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's an Alpha?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.88,0:27:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的第一个剥皮行者 最强壮的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The … the first skinwalker, the strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.50,0:27:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的确很强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's plenty strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.79,0:27:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不觉得他是什么始祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, no, I-I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.70,0:27:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道别的镇上也有这种家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure there's guys like him in other towns.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.78,0:27:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可不是唯一的一群\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not the only pack out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.11,0:27:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 那你可以帮我们阻止这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fantastic. Then you can help us stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.22,0:27:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, I can't. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.92,0:27:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.73,0:27:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你们没明白 没人做得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you guys don't get it. No one can.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.13,0:27:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我转化的那些家伙 他们非常残忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys who turned me … they're ruthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.31,0:27:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, not helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.30,0:27:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,捡回来 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fetch this, dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.33,0:27:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.86,0:27:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 你准备对那家人做些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do to that family, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.25,0:28:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要撕裂那小男孩的喉咙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna put your jaws around that little boy's throat?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.43,0:28:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他压在身下 听着他对妈妈哭嚎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clamp down, listen to him cry for his mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.83,0:28:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I'm gonna guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.51,0:28:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他俩是你这悲惨的一生中\N{\fnArial\fs30}that these are the only people who in your pathetic life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.94,0:28:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一对你好的人了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}have ever showed you any kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.14,0:28:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你要么就那样干\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's either that…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.79,0:28:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么就帮助我们阻止这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you can help us stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.84,0:28:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.46,0:28:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么才能接近一群\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we supposed to get near something.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.98,0:28:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百码外就能闻到我们气味的家伙呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}that can smell us 100 yards off?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.69,0:28:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.59,0:28:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,兽群领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pack leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.45,0:28:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把他干掉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're taking him down?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.51,0:28:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你有更好的主意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Got a better idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.71,0:28:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.33,0:28:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这样的话 克劳力可能会不高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley's not gonna be too happy about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.30,0:28:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁鸟他高不高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who gives a rat's ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.96,0:28:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让那家伙多活一秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}We let that thing live one second,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.49,0:28:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就会给那群疯狗发出信号 那就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it sends out that psychic dog whistle and pchew!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.78,0:28:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,可另一方面 它也能带我们找到他们的始祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the other hand, it could lead us to an Alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.46,0:28:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那克劳力就能把我的灵魂还回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Crowley would give me my soul back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.54,0:28:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.19,0:29:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,150个人类被变成怪物 这就是你想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}150 people turned into monsters. That's what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.00,0:29:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 当然不是 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Of course not. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.29,0:29:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.25,0:29:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 你知道吗 就这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you know what? That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.11,0:29:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.99,0:29:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你是个老实人 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say you're "Just folks, " Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.07,0:29:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢棒球啊苹果派啊什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That … that you like baseball and apple pie or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.47,0:29:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但事实上 我不知道你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But truth is, I don't know what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.29,0:29:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 反正你不是萨姆 - 迪恩 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 'cause you're not Sam. - Dean, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.01,0:29:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你的大块头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's your gigantor body and …
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.37,0:29:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许连大脑都是萨姆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and maybe your brain,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.46,0:29:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.55,0:29:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就别装了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So just…stop pretending.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.26,0:29:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算帮咱俩的忙吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do us both a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.29,0:30:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看起来很紧张 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looks nervous, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.35,0:30:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,换你你不紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.98,0:30:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,换我 我会出卖我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd double-cross us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.39,0:30:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能会想到 如果还想活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he's got to realize that's his best bet,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.45,0:30:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,出卖我们就是他最好的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he wants to keep breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.59,0:30:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他会坚持到底的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, he'll go through with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.66,0:30:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 因为他爱那家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean 'cause he loves that family?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.49,0:30:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.96,0:30:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,换我 我还是会出卖我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd double-cross us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.85,0:30:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢你吉言 你可真会安慰人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, dexter. That's reassuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.74,0:30:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想聊点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just making conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.03,0:30:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.13,0:31:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个大个子 那个司机\N{\fnArial\fs30}That big guy, the driver …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.01,0:31:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,旺财在公园见的就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the guy Lucky met in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.88,0:31:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's el jefe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.87,0:31:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.01,0:31:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,旁边有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.68,0:31:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要确保一击毙命\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got one shot at this … literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.24,0:31:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.41,0:31:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.93,0:31:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她挡住我了 - 别管了 快开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's in the way. - Take it anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.06,0:31:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧来吧来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on. Ahh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.52,0:32:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在咋办 备用计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, plan "B"?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.25,0:32:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱有备用计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got one?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.78,0:32:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你们 不管你们想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.86,0:32:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你们放过我儿子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just please let my son go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.79,0:32:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 伙计 现在我也无能为力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, there's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.32,0:32:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boss is pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.51,0:32:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本未经许可\N{\fnArial\fs30}These murders that you've been doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.71,0:32:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就杀了那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't ask for permission!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.49,0:32:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会毁掉我们整个计划的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're gonna screw up the whole damn plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.39,0:32:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我警告过你了 - 我知道 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I tried to warn you. - I know. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.73,0:32:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这 这肯定有点误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}There … there's been a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.30,0:32:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟这事完全没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-This has got nothing to do with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.75,0:32:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这完全就是因你而起 大姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has everything to do with you, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.58,0:32:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 你还是不是我们一伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you with us or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.47,0:32:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 当然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.21,0:33:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 证明给我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.92,0:33:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,转化他们 就现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn them. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.38,0:33:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个都要 让我们亲眼看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of 'em, while we watch,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.99,0:33:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我就把你们都杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I'll kill you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.65,0:33:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦天呐…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.88,0:33:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.97,0:33:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 别怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mommy! - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.06,0:33:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼迪 过来 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mandy! Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.60,0:33:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁 我根本不认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?! I don't even know you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.23,0:33:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认识的 相信我 我是来帮你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you do. Trust me, I'm trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.76,0:33:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.75,0:34:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.33,0:34:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我不… - 快进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I don't … - Get in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.75,0:34:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁好 锁好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bolt it! Bolt it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.25,0:34:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 宝贝 躲在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, baby, go under here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.17,0:34:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 呆在那儿 宝贝 你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, stay there, honey. You'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.31,0:35:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在保护他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're protecting them?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.08,0:35:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你做了这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what I did for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.76,0:35:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给了你再活一次的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you your life back!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.37,0:35:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}them?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.96,0:35:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对他们来说一文不值\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're nothing to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.45,0:35:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是条狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.28,0:35:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我本来只想转化他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I was gonna turn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.02,0:35:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在 我要杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I'm gonna kill 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.50,0:35:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,旺财\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.13,0:35:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我会跟你来场狗之间的较量\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think this is gonna be a dogfight?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.48,0:35:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个更好的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.52,0:36:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,银弹 旺财\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silver bullet, Lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.72,0:37:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就说一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.49,0:37:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是要来打扰你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.94,0:37:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是… 我只想说一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…Uh, I just want to say one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.58,0:37:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和艾丹…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Aidan…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.86,0:37:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是我唯一的亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only family I ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.61,0:37:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know …
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.54,0:37:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这听起来… 我知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that sounds … I know…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.05,0:37:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.94,0:37:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.97,0:37:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是从没有人对我那么好过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that no one has ever been so nice to me before,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.12,0:37:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.74,0:37:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.85,0:38:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,离这屋子远点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from this house,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.27,0:38:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You psycho.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.05,0:38:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you ever,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.41,0:38:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,再接近我和我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever come near me or my son again,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.23,0:38:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So help me…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.88,0:38:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我活该…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I probably deserve…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.19,0:38:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗在我眼里永远不会跟以前一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never look at a dog the Same.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.27,0:38:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过还真难说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes you wonder, though, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.18,0:38:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么难说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.97,0:38:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底还有多少狗群\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many packs are out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.35,0:38:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它们都在等命令呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they're all just waiting for the signal, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.85,0:39:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.02,0:39:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.38,0:39:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}About?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.63,0:39:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.16,0:39:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.19,0:39:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.83,0:39:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些什么「我还是原来的我」\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that "Blah, blah, blah, " About being the old me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.30,0:39:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.10,0:39:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就拿莉莎和本来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Lisa and Ben, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.50,0:39:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直装作在乎他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been acting like I care about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.27,0:39:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我不在乎 一点也不\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't. I couldn't care less.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.73,0:39:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些会让我感觉好受些么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this supposed to make me feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.10,0:39:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要个真实的我 这就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted the real me. This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.19,0:39:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不在乎他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.35,0:39:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至都不真的在乎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even really care about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.44,0:39:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except that…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.37,0:39:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.61,0:39:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不直截了当跟你明说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're clearly not gonna stick around for much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.83,0:39:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明显就快忍不下去了 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless I give it to you straight, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.79,0:39:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确做过许多坏事 比你想的还坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done a lot worse than you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.66,0:39:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在猎魔的过程中杀过无辜的人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've killed innocent people in the line of duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.60,0:39:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我确信\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm pretty sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.29,0:39:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是以前的我会做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not something the old me could've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.49,0:40:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我应该有罪恶感\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe I should feel guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.43,0:40:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.44,0:40:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 说重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, get to the punch line.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.14,0:40:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这样的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if how I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.00,0:40:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是好是坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is better or worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.25,0:40:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这感觉很不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.63,0:40:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成了任务 却感觉不到任何伤痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get the job done, and nothing really hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.60,0:40:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也不算是最糟糕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not the worst thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.41,0:40:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.97,0:40:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经的萨姆都不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was that other Sam for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.30,0:40:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.75,0:40:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,做那样的萨姆很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was kinda harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.23,0:40:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我同样记得 做那样的萨姆…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there are also things about it I remember that I…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.48,0:40:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just say.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.10,0:40:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我还是该重新变回原来的萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I should probably go back to being him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.80,0:40:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.61,0:40:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迈出了一大步\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a step.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.83,0:41:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.24,0:41:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做我们该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do what we got to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.16,0:41:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去把我弟弟找回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we get my brother back.
